            <title><![CDATA[Show HN: I Turned DOOM into a Transformer (119 pts)]]></title>
            <link>https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer</link>
            <guid>50297697</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 23:25:46 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer">https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50297697">Hacker News</a></p>
<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div data-hpc="true" containertiming="hpc"><article itemprop="text"><p dir="auto">
  <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer/releases/download/v0.4.0/banner_wide.png"><img src="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer/releases/download/v0.4.0/banner_wide.png" alt="DOOMFORMER: the marine fights a horde of demons under a hellish sky" width="100%"></a>
</p>
<p dir="auto">
  <b>Neural networks computed by voodoo dolls inside DOOM maps.</b><br>
  Every value is read back and checked against NumPy. Tolerance 0.
</p>
<p dir="auto">
  <a href="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer/actions/workflows/tests.yml"><img src="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer/actions/workflows/tests.yml/badge.svg" alt="tests"></a>
