<p dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" dir="auto">How it works</h2><a id="user-content-how-it-works" aria-label="Permalink: How it works" href="#how-it-works"></a></p>
<p dir="auto">Every part of a network becomes a part of the map:</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>in a neural network</th>
<th>in the DOOM map</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>a value of 5</td>
<td>5 voodoo dolls</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>a weight</td>
<td>a line on the floor; each doll that crosses it adds the weight</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>a sum</td>
<td>a sector's light level or floor height</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>an activation (ReLU)</td>
<td>a staircase of gates the dolls must climb</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>attention</td>
<td>dolls squeezing under ceilings that another value lowered</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>a lesion</td>
<td>a closed door</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
