<p dir="auto">ACS level scripts move gates, rewind the dolls, sense the world and copy results out. Two do more. <code>df.Agent</code> takes an
argmax in ACS. <code>--opt 3</code> copies each layer's values into the next layer with a script.
<a href="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer/blob/main/docs/HOW_IT_WORKS.md#who-does-what-per-demo">Per demo</a></p>
<p dir="auto">The maps need ZDoom (UDMF and ACS). This repo runs <a href="https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/ViZDoom">ViZDoom</a> 1.3.2 with
Freedoom assets.</p>
