<p dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" dir="auto">Bigger experiments</h2><a id="user-content-bigger-experiments" aria-label="Permalink: Bigger experiments" href="#bigger-experiments"></a></p>
<p dir="auto">
  <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer/releases/download/v0.1.0/hero.gif"><img src="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer/releases/download/v0.1.0/hero.gif" alt="His brain is the level: the marine fights a demon while 1,345 dots on the right, voodoo dolls of him, run his policy transformer" width="720" data-animated-image=""></a>
</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>His brain is the level.</strong> The level senses the nearest demon. 1,345 voodoo dolls of the marine run his brain and pick
an action. The level turns him and fires. Python only steps the clock and reads. 50 of 50 decisions are exact.
