<div dir="auto"><p dir="auto">Warning</p><p dir="auto">He is not playable. One decision takes 22 s of game time, and the demons are frozen while he thinks. With the demons
awake (<code>--live</code>), he dies in 5.5 s without a kill. <a href="https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer/blob/main/docs/DEMOS.md#live-demons-what-the-latency-costs-him">Live demons</a></p>
