<figure id="food-queue"><details open=""><summary><code>notes/food-queue.md</code><a href="https://labs.ycombinator.com/civ50/shared-machine/notes/food-queue.md" download="">Download</a></summary><pre tabindex="0" aria-label="notes/food-queue.md"><code># Food queue — Ines maintains; snapshot day time2387
